 o dispositivi di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lh5IHzd1vP8Q7kNvwFa-kod&_nc_oc=AdoABz2vA1i6CFMl5on6I8-oDRgBctj9bTRGHWKE8fDbFLRxH4moTmCNrWb5fjmiASI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSubjpfuw6-J5PRKXmxXWNpl_VU5ca_gonTA8NGx5n7hQ&oe=6B0DADE3"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KPLXrUViMKsQ7kNvwEeIMVl&_nc_oc=Ado8vplJ-xsPX5CY-WhlDIMVD1Ps3ItU410k_Qp2TpoNk5K8V_q89xrj5WK6VskX-N8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRMNAi5IaDxDMyH8M_iCdPVTZVmqTAizBHijdUotiECxQ&oe=6B0DD21D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=f73s_vm0qaQQ7kNvwEquBfK&_nc_oc=AdpdTuykgqXErDPHHuqS2IdtqQ4M6PeUyKUiDJVEQDI2EBVcRoJCEmvxArvhpIUjWno&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQaZ6pZC_BQJBzw3CSlVS4ld9